  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Fund: Science Forum South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science Forum South Africa (SFSA) is a unique opportunity to showcase HMG&#x2019;s extensive collaboration in South Africa with the potential to build new partnerships for the UKinSA and the region. SFSA is an opportunity for the UK to demonstrate global research and innovation leadership and enable a better understanding of the South African challenges and approaches. It is a timely and ideal platform for HMG to demonstrate alignment with South African priorities as South Africa prepares to chair the G20 in 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
